Package: edgeai-tidl-models
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: TI EdgeAI pre-trained TIDL inference models
 Pre-trained deep learning models for TI EdgeAI inference demos, covering
 image classification, object detection, and semantic segmentation.
 Models are provided in ONNX, TFLite, and TVM formats, optimised and
 compiled for TIDL acceleration on TI J7x/AM6x SoCs.
 .
 Installed to /opt/model_zoo/.
 .
 Compatible with: j721e, j721s2, j784s4, j722s, am62axx.
